    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mo>an</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></math>,</p><p>If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn></math> limit does not exist and if <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, then</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p>",
